Three hundred eighty-seven personnel have indicated
another language as their mother tongue.
2. Yes.
(a) The increase will be to about 83,000 (regular force personnel) in accordance with the decision announced in 1977. The increase will be in annual increments, the size of which will be governed by the needs of the forces and the fiscal constraints existing each year.
